          "section": "Abstract",
          "quote": "Understanding the transformation behavior of the oxide layer on FGH96 powders during sintering should be in terms of oxides formation, decomposition and the diffusion of oxygen. This study investigates the early sintering stages of FGH96 superalloys, revealing the transformation of amorphous oxide layer into stable (Al2O3, ZrO2) and unstable (NiO, CoO, Cr2O3, TiO2) crystalline particles.",
